{"seq":3,"slug":"training-pipeline","title":"数据工程与训练流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations/training-pipeline","wordCount":1455,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据工程与训练流水线\">数据工程与训练流水线</h1><p>&quot;Garbage in, garbage out&quot; 在 CV 领域被反复验证——一个精心设计的数据流水线带来的精度提升往往超过更换模型架构。本文覆盖从原始数据到训练完成的完整工程链路：数据采集与标注策略、增强流水线设计、分布式训练架构、以及超参调优的系统化方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CV 训练流水线是一个多阶段的数据处理系统，每个环节的工程质量都直接影响最终模型性能：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始数据采集] --&gt; B[数据清洗与去重]&#10;    B --&gt; C[标注工作流]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据增强流水线]&#10;    D --&gt; E[DataLoader / 预处理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[分布式训练]&#10;    F --&gt; G[验证与早停]&#10;    G --&gt; H[模型导出与版本管理]&#10;    C --&gt;|SAM 2 辅助标注| C&#10;    D --&gt;|在线增强 vs 离线增强| D\">graph TD\n    A[原始数据采集] --&gt; B[数据清洗与去重]\n    B --&gt; C[标注工作流]\n    C --&gt; D[数据增强流水线]\n    D --&gt; E[DataLoader / 预处理]\n    E --&gt; F[分布式训练]\n    F --&gt; G[验证与早停]\n    G --&gt; H[模型导出与版本管理]\n    C --&gt;|SAM 2 辅助标注| C\n    D --&gt;|在线增强 vs 离线增强| D</pre><h2 id=\"数据采集与标注策略\">数据采集与标注策略</h2><p><strong>标注工具生态（2026）：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Label Studio</td>\n<td>开源、多任务、支持 ML Backend</td>\n<td>中小团队通用标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CVAT</td>\n<td>Intel 开源、视频标注强</td>\n<td>视频检测/跟踪标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roboflow</td>\n<td>SaaS、自动增强与版本管理</td>\n<td>快速原型与小团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAM 2 + 自定义 UI</td>\n<td>交互式零样本分割</td>\n<td>减少 85% 标注点击量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scale AI / Labelbox</td>\n<td>商业级、大规模人力</td>\n<td>数十万帧的工业项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>主动学习（Active Learning）循环</strong>：不要一次标注所有数据。先标注一小批 → 训练初版模型 → 用模型的不确定性筛选最有信息量的样本 → 优先标注这些样本。实践中可将标注成本降低 40-60%。</p>\n<p><strong>数据质量 &gt; 数据数量</strong>：Google Brain 的研究表明，在 ImageNet 规模上去除 30% 的噪声标签后重新训练，精度反而提升。工程上需要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一致性检查：同一样本多人标注，Cohen&#39;s Kappa <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>离群检测：用预训练模型 embedding + UMAP 可视化，剔除分布异常样本</li>\n<li>版本控制：DVC（Data Version Control）跟踪数据集每次变更</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据增强设计\">数据增强设计</h2><p>增强的目标是在不改变语义的前提下扩展训练分布。按强度分层：</p>\n<p><strong>基础增强（几乎总是使用）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>随机水平翻转</li>\n<li>随机裁剪与缩放（Scale Jitter 0.5-1.5x）</li>\n<li>色彩抖动（亮度/对比度/饱和度 ±20%）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>中等增强（多数场景有效）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mosaic：4 张图拼为 1 张，增加小目标在同一 batch 内的密度</li>\n<li>MixUp：两张图按比例线性混合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{x} = \\lambda x_i + (1-\\lambda) x_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>CutMix：将一张图的矩形区域粘贴到另一张图上</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>强增强（需验证，可能伤害特定任务）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>RandAugment / AutoAugment：搜索增强策略组合</li>\n<li>GridMask / CutOut：随机遮挡区域</li>\n<li>风格迁移增强：用 Neural Style Transfer 生成跨域样本</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>检测/分割任务的增强约束</strong>：增强必须与标注同步变换。翻转图像时 bbox 也必须翻转；裁剪时检查目标是否仍在画面内（可见面积 &lt; 阈值则丢弃）。Albumentations 库原生支持 bbox 和 mask 的联合变换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式训练架构\">分布式训练架构</h2><p>单卡训练已无法满足现代 CV 模型的需求。ViT-L 在 ImageNet-21K 上的预训练需要数百 GPU·天。分布式训练的核心选择：</p>\n<p><strong>数据并行（Data Parallel）</strong>：最常用。每张卡持有完整模型副本，batch 被分片到各卡，梯度通过 AllReduce 同步。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PyTorch DDP（DistributedDataParallel）是标准实现，注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 NCCL 后端（GPU 间通信最优）</li>\n<li>SyncBatchNorm 替代普通 BN</li>\n<li>有效 batch size = 单卡 batch × GPU 数，需按线性缩放规则调整学习率</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混合精度训练（AMP）</strong>：前向用 FP16 计算（速度快 2x），反向仍保留 FP32 主权重（精度不损）。GradScaler 防止 FP16 下溢。2026 年的标准是用 BF16（动态范围更大，不需要 loss scaling）。</p>\n<p><strong>DeepSpeed ZeRO / FSDP</strong>：当单卡放不下模型时，将优化器状态/梯度/参数分片到多卡。ZeRO-Stage2 在不增加通信量的情况下将内存占用降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超参调优的系统化方法\">超参调优的系统化方法</h2><p>不要手动&quot;炼丹&quot;。遵循有结构的调参流程：</p>\n<p><strong>学习率</strong>：最重要的超参。使用 LR Finder（Leslie Smith）扫描 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，找到 loss 下降最快的区间。典型配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>余弦退火（Cosine Annealing）+ 线性 warmup</li>\n<li>峰值 LR：AdamW 通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-3 \\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，SGD 通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01-0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>批大小</strong>：在显存允许范围内尽量大（加速收敛），但超过临界点后泛化会下降。梯度累积可在不增加显存的情况下模拟大 batch。</p>\n<p><strong>权重衰减</strong>：AdamW 的解耦权重衰减通常设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01-0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>。注意 BN/LN 的参数不应施加权重衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>EMA（指数移动平均）</strong>：训练过程中维护参数的 EMA 版本用于评估，decay 通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.9999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.9999</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9999</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>EMA</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>EMA</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{EMA}} = \\alpha \\cdot \\theta_{\\text{EMA}} + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EMA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EMA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"实验管理与可复现性\">实验管理与可复现性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Weights &amp; Biases</td>\n<td>指标追踪、超参搜索、模型注册</td>\n<td>几行代码侵入式集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLflow</td>\n<td>实验追踪、模型注册、部署</td>\n<td>开源自建，适合私有化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DVC</td>\n<td>数据与模型版本控制</td>\n<td>与 Git 协同，pipeline 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hydra</td>\n<td>配置管理</td>\n<td>多实验组合不改代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可复现性清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>固定所有随机种子（Python/NumPy/PyTorch/CUDA）</li>\n<li>记录完整环境（<code>pip freeze</code> / Docker image hash）</li>\n<li>配置文件与代码一起版本控制</li>\n<li>训练 checkpoint 定期保存（至少 best + last）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据质量决定模型上限，标注一致性和主动学习是降本增效的关键</li>\n<li>数据增强需分层设计，检测/分割任务须保证标注同步变换</li>\n<li>分布式训练选 DDP + AMP 作为默认起点，大模型用 FSDP/ZeRO</li>\n<li>超参调优遵循结构化流程（LR Finder → 余弦退火 → EMA）</li>\n<li>实验管理工具保证可复现性，是工程化团队的基础设施</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇 <a href=\"vision-transformer\">Vision Transformer 架构</a> 中的训练稳定性技巧与本文互补</li>\n<li>跨库参考：大规模训练基础设施的通用原理见 <a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/engineering/training-infrastructure\">训练基础设施</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据工程与训练流水线","id":"数据工程与训练流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据采集与标注策略","id":"数据采集与标注策略"},{"level":2,"text":"数据增强设计","id":"数据增强设计"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式训练架构","id":"分布式训练架构"},{"level":2,"text":"超参调优的系统化方法","id":"超参调优的系统化方法"},{"level":2,"text":"实验管理与可复现性","id":"实验管理与可复现性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Vision Transformer 架构与工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations/vision-transformer"},"next":{"title":"YOLO 系列演进与 YOLOv11 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/yolo-evolution"}}